    "html": "<p>A ball of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.40\\text{ kg}\"></span> is moving horizontally at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span> when it strikes a vertical wall. It rebounds horizontally with a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\text{ m s}^{-1}\"></span>. The ball is in contact with the wall for a time of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.20\\text{ s}\"></span>. What is the average net force exerted on the ball during the impact?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.2\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"16\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\\text{ N}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
